{
  "Logging": {
    "File": {
      "RetainDays": 30
    },
    "LogLevel": {
      "Default": "Information",
      "Microsoft.Hosting.Lifetime": "Information",
      "Microsoft": "Warning"
    }
  },
  "Holiday": {
    "ApiHubsApiKey": ""
  },
  "InputActivity": {
    "Enabled": true,
    "PersistIntervalMinutes": 10
  },
  "Notifications": {
    "Provider": "Teams",
    "TeamsWebhookUrl": "",
    "WeComWebhookUrl": "",
    "DingTalkWebhookUrl": "",
    "Rules": [
      {
        "Id": "timesheet",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Title": "Timesheet",
        "Message": "本周最后一个工作日，请填写 Timesheet。",
        "Time": "11:00",
        "Schedule": "LastWorkdayOfWeek",
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 60,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      },
      {
        "Id": "lunch",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Title": "恰饭君",
        "Message": "可以开始着手准备12点的补给。",
        "Time": "11:50",
        "Schedule": "DailyWorkday",
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 30,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      },
      {
        "Id": "monthly-task",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Title": "Task Review",
        "Message": "• 关闭所有已完成，且下个迭代不需要再投入的 Task/US\n  Ready for Release、Release 状态的 US 不需要处理，但需确保该状态下的 Task 都是 Closed 状态\n\n• 如果当前迭代未完成 (Develop, QA....), 且下个迭代需要继续投入，则需对US进行转接(carry-over)，步骤如下：\n\n1. Close当前迭代需要转接的US，和下面所有的Task/Bug;\n2. Copy当前US (Create a copy from workitem...), 修改iteration path为下个迭代;\n3. 在US的标题上标记转接信息，如：被转接的US, 末尾带上Phase1, 转接后的US: Phase2。",
        "Time": "17:00",
        "Schedule": "LastWorkdayOfMonth",
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 60,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      },
      {
        "Id": "daily-standup",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Title": "准备日报",
        "Message": "今天工作即将结束，开始准备 Daily Standup 信息。",
        "Time": "17:50",
        "Schedule": "DailyWorkday",
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 30,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      },
      {
        "Id": "daily-input-stats",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Title": "今日输入统计",
        "Message": "",
        "Time": "18:00",
        "Schedule": "DailyWorkday",
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 0,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      },
      {
        "Id": "outlook-running",
        "Enabled": true,
        "Kind": "ProcessAbsent",
        "Title": "启动 Outlook",
        "Message": "Outlook 已超过 30 分钟没有运行，请启动 Outlook。",
        "Time": "00:00",
        "Schedule": "DailyWorkday",
        "ProcessNames": [ "olk", "OUTLOOK" ],
        "AbsentMinutes": 30,
        "RequireAtOfficeMinutes": 0,
        "SkewMinutes": 10
      }
    ]
  }
}
